  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "tekutiny",
      "title": "Tělní tekutiny a úlohy krve",
      "summary": "Propojíš krev, tkáňový mok a stálost vnitřního prostředí s hlavními funkcemi krve.",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 4
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Prezentace propojuje krev, tkáňový mok a mízu se stálostí vnitřního prostředí neboli homeostázou.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 4
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Krev rozvádí kyslík, živiny a další látky, odvádí zplodiny a podílí se na udržování tělesné teploty.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 4
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Rozlišuj krevní plazmu a krevní tělíska; nejde o dvě označení stejné složky.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 3
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 4
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "teliska",
      "title": "Tři skupiny krevních tělísek",
      "summary": "Odlišíš erytrocyty, leukocyty a krevní destičky podle jejich popisu v podkladu.",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 9
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 14
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Erytrocyty se podílejí na přenosu kyslíku pomocí hemoglobinu. Leukocyty obsahují jádro a účastní se obranných reakcí.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 7
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 9
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 12
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 14
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Krevní destičky jsou buněčné úlomky a jsou důležité pro srážení krve. Podrobnosti imunity jsou samostatné téma.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 7
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 9
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 12
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 14
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cevy",
      "title": "Cévy a jejich stěna",
      "summary": "Porovnáš typy cév a prohlédneš si původní schéma vrstev cévní stěny.",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 18
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 19
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 21
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Přehled rozlišuje tepny, vlásečnice a žíly. Aorta je v podkladu uvedena jako výstup z levé komory.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 18
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 19
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 21
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Plicnice a plicní žíly si pamatuj podle směru propojení srdce a plic, nikoli podle univerzálního pravidla o barvě cévy.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 18
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 19
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 21
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obeh",
      "title": "Srdce, malý a velký krevní oběh",
      "summary": "Propojíš čtyři srdeční oddíly s cévami a sleduješ cestu krve mezi srdcem, plícemi a tělem.",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 21
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 22
        },
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 23
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Prezentace rozlišuje malý neboli plicní a velký neboli tělní krevní oběh.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 20
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 21
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 22
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 23
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Pravá síň přijímá krev z dutých žil. Pravá komora ji posílá plicnicí do plic. Plicní žíly ústí do levé síně a levá komora vypuzuje krev aortou do těla.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 20
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 21
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 22
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 23
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Na čelním schématu je anatomická pravá strana vlevo na obrázku; názvy síní a komor nepřehazuj podle své pravé ruky.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 20
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 21
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 22
            },
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 23
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cyklus",
      "title": "Systola, diastola a objem krve",
      "summary": "Odlišíš stažení a ochabnutí srdeční svaloviny a propojíš tepový a minutový objem.",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
          "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
          "page": 25
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Systola označuje kontrakci srdeční svaloviny, diastola její ochabnutí.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 25
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Minutový objem je tepový objem násobený počtem tepů za minutu. Jde o školní vztah pro výpočet, nikoli o individuální zdravotní hodnocení.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "f8690ce77418fba30b74ac833248ca46fdef20cc91dcb64314949644a7d51a42",
              "sha256": "e8c64158329cc67bbb9c5bdc6e3e872f7dc49ec26a0ddb47437f4d8ae88ff1fe",
              "page": 25
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
